<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Milpo started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Milpo started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said on Thursday it had started coverage of Peruvian mining company Compaa Minera Milpo SA with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Soaring zinc prices (will) spur impressive earnings growth in 1997-98,&quot; the firm said in a report.</p>
<p>-- &quot;An increase in reserves points to a capacity expansion ... (and) we recommend a buy on Milpo's growth potential as a zinc play.&quot;</p>
<p>Milpo fell five centavos to 19.50 soles.</p>
<p>((-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk 212 859-1879))</p>
